# The sitemap's lastmod state is a committed content hash of every page
# (seo/sitemap-lastmod.json). A checkout that rewrites line endings would miss
# all 209 hashes at once, fail the staleness test and re-date the whole sitemap
# on the next build. Pin the bytes so the hash means the same thing everywhere.
*.html text eol=lf
*.json text eol=lf
*.mjs  text eol=lf
*.js   text eol=lf
*.css  text eol=lf
*.xml  text eol=lf
